# Byte-identical goldens are this repo's central discipline, and git's
# line-ending normalization silently corrupts it: core.autocrlf=true on a
# Windows checkout would rewrite every fixture's newlines, so a golden diff
# would lie without anyone touching a scene. Pin the repo to LF everywhere,
# and mark fixture families as binary — byte-exact means byte-exact,
# including trailing whitespace. Set before there is code, because the day
# fixtures exist is the day a wrong setting becomes a migration event.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.frame -text
*.golden -text
*.json -text
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
